e, 'server': False, 'terminated': False, 'seed': 2431508474, 'tick': 342, 'phase': 'playing', 'wave': 0, 'bossPhase': 0, 'score': 0, 'players': [{'id': 0, 'x': 170, 'hp': 3, 'connected': True}, {'id': 1, 'x': 338.3333333333326, 'hp': 3, 'connected': True}], 'enemies': 18, 'threats': [], 'brake': 0, 'seen': ['wave0'], 'modified': False, 'music': 0.1, 'input': 'keyboard', 'packets': {'sent': 31, 'bytes': 15814, 'maxBytes': 961, 'maxSecond': 11, 'rejected': 0}, 'errors': []}, 'guest': {'title': 'Attack of the Time Bandit Boss', 'scene': 'play', 'screen': None, 'paused': False, 'demo': False, 'hosted': False, 'server': False, 'terminated': False, 'seed': 2431508474, 'tick': 361, 'phase': 'playing', 'wave': 0, 'bossPhase': 0, 'score': 0, 'players': [{'id': 0, 'x': 170, 'hp': 3, 'connected': True}, {'id': 1, 'x': 338.3, 'hp': 3, 'connected': True}], 'enemies': 18, 'threats': [], 'brake': 0, 'seen': None, 'modified': False, 'music': 0.1, 'input': 'keyboard', 'packets': {'sent': 36, 'bytes': 1679, 'maxBytes': 47, 'maxSecond': 13, 'rejected': 0}, 'errors': []}}}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_54","type":"agent_message","text":"All four required Hub harness scenarios passed, including stressed four-player play, host departure, and server-hosted play. Two independent browser contexts also established a real WebRTC room and completed ready/start, play, results, replay, and leave flows. Browser testing found and fixed a first-mouse-movement targeting bug; I’m strengthening the shared-gameplay checks next."}}
