C connection passed create/join/ready/start, remote move/fire, results, replay, guest leave, host leave, failed join and solo fallback.\\\\n- Extra Hub gameplay test used play=12 milliseconds instead of 20000; corrected fixture.\\\\n- Found/fixed title clipping, first-pointer targeting, narrow/high-DPR scaling, terminal audio reactivation, and guest brake edges sampled only at packet cadence. Latest engine patch also adds hidden developer rows and fractional downscaling; Hub client still unmodified.\\\\n- Tests are \"'`node tools/test.mjs [state|browser|network]`; evidence in development artifacts/. Ongoing browser and then network reruns.'\"\\\\n- Next: finish extra network gameplay/brake checks, source formatting, final metadata/feedback, verification doc and contact sheet; rebuild and verify delivered artifact.\\\\n''')\nPY\nnode tools/build.mjs --quiet\nnode tools/test.mjs network\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
